"gn9mDbnYTamOpS149VkJAg","children":[]},{"id":"133","parent":"131","text":"2 episodios → ≥2 años","guid":"z6xXEs03SRyNlXfcmHPA6g","children":[]},{"id":"134","parent":"131","text":"≥3 episodios o severidad alta → ≥3 años o indefinido","guid":"bACS3ddIQQuroE7TEsQHlw","children":[]}]},{"id":"135","parent":"118","text":"En geriatría tendemos a DESPRESCRIBIR","guid":"5Hp4lSHBRaesK_bm_Wy_Mg","children":[]},{"id":"136","parent":"118","text":"Resultado esperado real","guid":"V69pMSe-RZeJpoSHZNgVPw","children":[{"id":"137","parent":"136","text":"1/3 logra remisión con primer esquema","guid":"WE6yrPf-QMem-LPnOLsJow","children":[]},{"id":"138","parent":"136","text":"2/3 requieren ajustes / cambio","guid":"A1Q7mMK_TCuONPSh2GnBCw","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"139","parent":"0","text":"Antidepresivos — guía práctica","guid":"9tZ48kMxS-i72P5qiRdmxQ","children":[{"id":"140","parent":"139","text":"Lo que NO se debe usar (Beers)","guid":"yUqq7BB3SziwEU5FB8QdfQ","children":[{"id":"141","parent":"140","text":"Tricíclicos (TCAs) → carga anticolinérgica → caídas, deterioro cognitivo","guid":"FlMr7M3ZSTqga9fdOlRXdg","children":[]},{"id":"142","parent":"140","text":"Paroxetina → anticolinérgica, sedante → evitar","guid":"NnR5Ywe2SFSrJSVvnUigtA","children":[]}]},{"id":"143","parent":"139","text":"Primera línea — ISRS","guid":"uzande1JQu6Zyo1xhzwYjQ","children":[{"id":"144","parent":"143","text":"Características","guid":"njS94jwFTjyvH1J4PzZlHQ","children":[{"id":"145","parent":"144","text":"Baratos, bien tolerados, GES","guid":"0TtEPM7OQlGWZlvLuJhNFw","children":[]},{"id":"146","parent":"144","text":"Poco cardiotóxicos","guid":"XEBQVRalTEOBz8P5__VN6A","children":[]},{"id":"147","parent":"144","text":"Útiles en frágiles","guid":"__9L8MO6Q268CI2efGr9Vw","children":[]},{"id":"148","parent":"144","text":"Pueden darse con comida (reducir GI iniciales)","guid":"mtTQKMFvSU2kf6Ef-rR4vA","children":[]},{"id":"149","parent":"144","text":"Riesgo de HIPONATREMIA → controlar Na+ a 2 sem / 1 mes / ajustes (más si tiazidas, opioides, tramadol, carbamazepina)","guid":"5lWT0xf5Rry6cu51V0GYYQ","children":[]},{"id":"150","parent":"144","text":"↑ sangrado GI con AINE / corticoides / antiplaquetarios","guid":"2gwhAFU1SruYZ1oDB9TgqA","children":[]},{"id":"151","parent":"144","text":"↑ riesgo osteoporosis / fracturas","guid":"MIdkGpmuRJGWMCE6S6m0Hw","children":[]}]},{"id":"152","parent":"143","text":"Fármacos","guid":"PgZG3vXJRP-z-KrZLEh1xQ","children":[{"id":"153","parent":"152","text":"Sertralina → segura, bien tolerada, poca interacción → PREFERIDA","guid":"NFVDivTmS5SwI62boViR6w","children":[]},{"id":"154","parent":"152","text":"Escitalopram → bien tolerado","guid":"M3tQmE9aQ1uoTHIru1b2Hg","children":[]},{"id":"155","parent":"152","text":"Citalopram → NO subir >20 mg (QT) → útil en perfiles ansiosos","guid":"CH9pC0VOQFynEcQFv3I6lg","children":[]},{"id":"156","parent":"152","text":"Paroxetina → EVITAR (anticolinérgica)","guid":"484Sk-2GSHe80CRfKHgOLA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"157","parent":"139","text":"Segunda línea — Duales (IRSN)","guid":"NQE4tO5nQdCWRPGMpWaHWw","children":[{"id":"158","parent":"157","text":"Duloxetina → dolor crónico, neuropático, fibromialgia (30-60 mg) → sequedad, constipación, sudoración, mareo","guid":"zGHk5L5oRW-AHCucHXtWEQ","children":[]},{"id":"159","parent":"157","text":"Venlafaxina → ansiedad generalizada; usar liberación prolongada (síndrome de retirada); ↑ PA, ↓ umbral convulsivante","guid":"yEAP1eOZQSaR1-F6DmigUA","children":[]}]},{"id":"160","parent":"139","text":"Otros con perfiles específicos","guid":"Us0ePQrmRyWmHn-CdF8puA","children":[{"id":"161","parent":"160","text":"Mirtazapina → CABALLITO de batalla del geriatra","guid":"-44NPRg6TRyF5qbOjJh5dg","children":[{"id":"162","parent":"161","text":"Sedante, abre el apetito","guid":"d0EJuSEsTWOH6UD8QJgx7w","children":[]},{"id":"163","parent":"161","text":"Ideal en insomnio + bajo peso + ansiedad/depresión","guid":"_OKp7PSxRymxY6XdBZJuEg","children":[]},{"id":"164","parent":"161","text":"Segura en Parkinson (no aumenta temblor)","guid":"YiJT1F-6Qv6iOluWtyqFfg","children":[]},{"id":"165","parent":"161","text":"Dosis 15 mg → 30 mg (subir rápido en 1 sem; a dosis bajas paradójicamente más sedante)","guid":"JlHBVcwoTGWSqdc_0q1HGA","children":[]}]},{"id":"166","parent":"160","text":"Bupropión → activante, no afecta líbido; ↓ umbral convulsivante; puede gatillar psicosis","guid":"lc64sjsYQD66xthrL02Nag","children":[]},{"id":"167","parent":"160","text":"Vortioxetina → cara en Chile; mejora cognición; aprobada FDA depresión recurrente; ~23% efectos GI/náusea → subir lento","guid":"gIvwZ5H0Qm-gqo6zT10HlA","children":[]}]},{"id":"168","parent":"139","text":"Efectos adversos relevantes — tabla resumen","guid":"M6k4-E3RRu6F6AqDISwcXw","children":[{"id":"169","parent":"168","text":"Sangrado GI → ISRS (sobre todo con AINE/corticoides/antiplaq)","guid":"V4aDagZESZK_BWfMfH72uw","children":[]},{"id":"170","parent":"168","text":"Hiponatremia → ISRS, IRSN (primer mes y ajustes)","guid":"NuA7PfkeRGCliK7It1mHgA","children":[]},{"id":"171","parent":"168","text":"Osteoporosis / fracturas → ISRS, no selectivos","guid":"sgRcpwvFTneCy0UYJcCrDA","children":[]},{"id":"172","parent":"168","text":"Prolongación QT → Citalopram, amitriptilina","guid":"ix1AdqQxRdyabLoc4zA78w","children":[]},{"id":"173","parent":"168","text":"↑ PA → Venlafaxina","guid":"TRgzsb0qTsqpdikQIOlZDA","children":[]},{"id":"174","parent":"168","text":"Anticolinérgicos → TCAs, Paroxetina","guid":"iDmctVhESEmuWieKgvD1Qg","children":[]},{"id":"175","parent":"168","text":"Disfunción sexual → todos (↑ citalopram, paroxetina; ↓ bupropión)","guid":"pR49iG-wTe26qd9Nr2N6Zg","children":[]},{"id":"176","parent":"168","text":"Bajo umbral convulsivante → Venlafaxina, Bupropión","guid":"oMA2cyp5QMeiEiN4Dwef6g","children":[]}]},{"id":"177","parent":"139","text":"Herramientas para prescripción cuidadosa","guid":"rhXsAOf_Sre-7LhwsXlIIg","children":[{"id":"178","parent":"177","text":"Criterios de Beers","guid":"EHan3SXWTKChu2gF0Kd4fQ","children":[]},{"id":"179","parent":"177","text":"STOPP/START","guid":"cm3QI_lYRv-vowDzUaph6A","children":[]},{"id":"180","parent":"177","text":"Escala anticolinérgica","guid":"_WvbpaefQ7Wju6DlaZ6yPQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"181","parent":"0","text":"Depresión resistente al tratamiento (Steffens NEJM 2024)","guid":"Wfl3lEulSZ-xlryfUGaF-Q","children":[{"id":"182","parent":"181","text":"Definición → falla a ≥2 esquemas adecuados en dosis y duración","guid":"BpmFtytmSB-Dz60xPon2Iw","children":[]},{"id":"183","parent":"181","text":"Estrategias","guid":"qxRTkBD9QpuqrsY_753MOw","children":[{"id":"184","parent":"183","text":"Optimizar dosis del antidepresivo actual","guid":"GObQMnjkS-CiLLSEyq_Mow","children":[]},{"id":"185","parent":"183","text":"Cambio a otro de distinta clase","guid":"VF9-n3ESQIubfoF0J64LOA","children":[]},{"id":"186","parent":"183","text":"Combinación de antidepresivos","guid":"Qce4cm-XTuaSmP8yoecAnA","children":[]},{"id":"187","parent":"183","text":"Augmentación con litio, aripiprazol, brexpiprazol, T3, ketamina/esketamina","guid":"x0CAD_75RRO-72qnRrE2XQ","children":[]},{"id":"188","parent":"183","text":"TEC sigue siendo gold standard cuando hay urgencia","guid":"opShCEaoTe2Nb2imk3YY7g","children":[]}]},{"id":"189","parent":"181","text":"Considerar derivar a especialista temprano","guid":"HS3odcjQT9Cn9WPGkNz3yA","children":[]}]},{"id":"190","parent":"0","text":"Terapia electroconvulsiva (TEC)","guid":"-Fxx96a9SyuS4BmA8U4drw","children":[{"id":"191","parent":"190","text":"Eficacia ~80%","guid":"S6mPWxzVSbesogNu1iMOIw","children":[]},{"id":"192","parent":"190","text":"Bien tolerada incluso en mayores frágiles","guid":"9Vh2NyusTdaM_Baiucq7vQ","children":[]},{"id":"193","parent":"190","text":"Mortalidad 1/10.000","guid":"R9uwC3f1R9KTAdO0spAoYQ","children":[]},{"id":"194","parent":"190","text":"Efectos adversos → náuseas, cefalea, dolor mandibular/muscular, ↑ caídas primeros días","guid":"JA8a39CBT1WclxsjrKXyfA","children":[]},{"id":"195","parent":"190","text":"Requiere evaluación preoperatoria","guid":"0LMC5xIIRnemrBDI3ScYnQ","children":[]},{"id":"196","parent":"190","text":"Indicaciones","guid":"J8Kz9yvvTV-DECjtLXLXmg","children":[{"id":"197","parent":"196","text":"Depresión refractaria","guid":"pCDL36daTlu4mXre-QqD7A","children":[]},{"id":"198","parent":"196","text":"Riesgo vital (rechazo comer, negación a medicamentos)","guid":"1xHKLXjmT0yr7qAwh-lmJA","children":[]},{"id":"199","parent":"196","text":"Depresión psicótica","guid":"DbTJw987TJSfFpBm2oSvDw","children":[]},{"id":"200","parent":"196","text":"Ideación suicida activa y persistente","guid":"JLUj03ueRIWzeBSJHzD9VQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"201","parent":"0","text":"Cuándo derivar a especialista","guid":"13CvgMA-Q8GRwdot_4VwuQ","children":[{"id":"202","parent":"201","text":"Alto riesgo de suicidio","guid":"Vhzo5zM2Sf6C50jvhPCJLQ","children":[]},{"id":"203","parent":"201","text":"Casos severos con riesgo vital","guid":"x_4ty-XMQ6qPatS2LTg7gA","children":[]},{"id":"204","parent":"201","text":"Depresión psicótica o catatónica","guid":"WHL7Xg4OTCCBxfNI1sJS9A","children":[]},{"id":"205","parent":"201","text":"Comorbilidades que dificultan fármacos habituales","guid":"PPmkrLEkS1igD-rSzS2Vlg","children":[]},{"id":"206","parent":"201","text":"Refractariedad a tratamiento","guid":"3mLMWSd5RwaWdzgPvFWTeg","children":[]},{"id":"207","parent":"201","text":"Duda diagnóstica o deterioro cognitivo asociado","guid":"5dFiUJkeQHK-GrgUz9rjMA","children":[]}]},{"id":"208","parent":"0","text":"Suicidio en la persona mayor (OPS 2014, MINSAL 2019)","guid":"ZhKqqV6KTbu-8kYg39HcEg","children":[{"id":"209","parent":"208","text":"Ideación suicida DISMINUYE con la edad","guid":"NCoEbR0vRMK4MVAy-cud1A","children":[]},{"id":"210","parent":"208","text":"PERO cuando existe en mayores → riesgo de suicidio efectivo MAYOR","guid":"0TbQopfMSWiEimb15WWeWQ","children":[]},{"id":"211","parent":"208","text":"Quienes intentan tienen más probabilidades de morir (lo logran)","guid":"DNPsT_f6R9mGuUYL9FtW3w","children":[]},{"id":"212","parent":"208","text":"19% de los suicidios en América en >60a","guid":"FCrTBdwGT8ur80IkkJqimA","children":[]},{"id":"213","parent":"208","text":">70a → tasa 12 por 100.000 (más alta que otros grupos)","guid":"aqUoH6KRQZmyK9VslwPWgg","children":[]},{"id":"214","parent":"208","text":"Factores de riesgo","guid":"YBVUVYczTNawLX1Pri6yQw","children":[{"id":"215","parent":"214","text":"Hombre","guid":"32Lnyw4YTa2w-mBbx_hT7w","children":[]},{"id":"216","parent":"214","text":"Viudo reciente","guid":"tOhpCZmVToW9edYFWR7v3Q","children":[]},{"id":"217","parent":"214","text":">80a","guid":"f-pybC7oTHe_ODzFVZ6myw","children":[]},{"id":"218","parent":"214","text":"Dolor crónico","guid":"GafhoMzkSn2tiRzalRBW_w","children":[]},{"id":"219","parent":"214","text":"Uso de sustancias (alcohol)","guid":"sD_UvuQNQOeJtBs7dqNauw","children":[]}]},{"id":"220","parent":"208","text":"Cómo abordar en entrevista","guid":"R1QqBXKaRzChkS_IrJbZuA","children":[{"id":"221","parent":"220","text":"Preguntar dirigidamente","guid":"q_ItK3OfTIi5gCUB7fsGWA","children":[]},{"id":"222","parent":"220","text":"Señales espontáneas","guid":"GaLzXpDBT_a5kyP279VpCw","children":[{"id":"223","parent":"222","text":"\"Ya no sirvo\"","guid":"9mw9vmgLSDaIVEHBF-nlKA","children":[]},{"id":"224","parent":"222","text":"\"Soy una carga\"","guid":"-if6EFQrTm2ejPBSfwUQFg","children":[]},{"id":"225","parent":"222","text":"\"Soy una molestia\"","guid":"iJi1JfSTSv6hEM9L6xjCug","children":[]},{"id":"226","parent":"222","text":"\"¿Para qué vivir tanto?\"","guid":"E85wXGVSTqaP9_6-1-X6lw","children":[]},{"id":"227","parent":"222","text":"\"Esto ya es mucho vivir\"","guid":"JvLpyD9UTFCc2V88olMvwQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"228","parent":"220","text":"HACERSE CARGO de lo que se encuentra","guid":"bFheSwxKQaaMYPvb6Ea1mQ","children":[]},{"id":"229","parent":"220","text":"Explorar ideas de muerte y de ideación suicida activa","guid":"Z_m1rhuiQP6TIAMTX_rDgA","children":[]}]},{"id":"230","parent":"208","text":"Recurso → Guía MINSAL 2019 (Salud Mental + prevención suicidio en PM)","guid":"YbwxdIhqQJeEA6bW4x43cg","children":[]}]},{"id":"231","parent":"0","text":"Preguntas Autoestudio (oficiales Dra. Marianne Born)","guid":"_xbrcdxmS0uIpQNGxa8KSw","children":[{"id":"232","parent":"231","text":"1. ¿De qué formas distintas a los síntomas y signos tradicionales se puede manifestar la depresión en las personas mayores?","guid":"Q4voAP0rSzOlW9_K1n0WaQ","children":[]},{"id":"233","parent":"231","text":"2. ¿Cuál es la familia de fármacos que (generalmente) se utilizan de primera línea para su tratamiento?","guid":"mCfj_R1LT4WbQ7pHsBGRMQ","children":[]},{"id":"234","parent":"231","text":"3. ¿Qué precauciones debería tomar en el uso de Citalopram?","guid":"WJxKXe_1RU-NuQkJkO3Adg","children":[]},{"id":"235","parent":"231","text":"4. ¿En qué escenario clínico puede ser de utilidad usar Mirtazapina como primera alternativa?","guid":"asfRtd2rRdqWpr8gKSaLug","children":[]},{"id":"236","parent":"231","text":"5. ¿Qué sabe sobre el suicidio y su prevención en la persona mayor?","guid":"q-9PXfHMRlazj5lt2ePzaA","children":[]},{"id":"237","parent":"231","text":"6. ¿Cada cuánto tiempo debemos realizar tamizaje de depresión?","guid":"dc4eyeUXQaWhzvBSsG9tLQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"238","parent":"0","text":"Evidencia complementaria (papers oficiales)","guid":"onebwhiBRzO5yrJcPTMjqQ","children":[{"id":"239","parent":"238","text":"Kok JAMA 2017 → revisión clásica de manejo de depresión en mayores","guid":"xAmnpNUdRoyzNhLT4y-cFA","children":[]},{"id":"240","parent":"238","text":"Simon JAMA 2024 → manejo de depresión en adultos (incluye mayores) actualizado","guid":"8kra4xYmSOylgerQea4ggw","children":[]},{"id":"241","parent":"238","text":"Steffens NEJM 2024 → depresión resistente al tratamiento en mayores; estrategias de augmentación + TEC","guid":"IyMqNRdnQ9aL4VN3RNOFfg","children":[]},{"id":"242","parent":"238","text":"Alexopoulos Transl Psychiatry 2019 → mecanismos de late-life depression (vascular + inflamatoria + neurodegenerativa)","guid":"BQx3uEXQQEm6WqwKAeO3dw","children":[]},{"id":"243","parent":"238","text":"Bergua Clin Gerontol 2026 → DSM-5 NO ajusta bien a mayores; sugiere ampliar criterios","guid":"F2gceaVhS4uarugtLwfLfw","children":[]},{"id":"244","parent":"238","text":"McCall Psychiatr Clin N Am 2013 → late-life depression como problema global con pocos recursos","guid":"q7zvKNy5RE-CZ__44lTUqw","children":[]},{"id":"245","parent":"238","text":"Glover Psychiatr Clin N Am 2013 → assessment del mayor con depresión tardía","guid":"f-T576H8RbC3GwETrOhTkg","children":[]},{"id":"246","parent":"238","text":"Kovich AFP 2023 → guía práctica de tratamiento farmacológico","guid":"HRuCrDc1Q-O0eHHguIsRBw","children":[]},{"id":"247","parent":"238","text":"Piel J Psychiatr Pract 2023 → revisión de estrategias terapéuticas para late-life depression","guid":"o1rODjstSLyI1PloQz9uhg","children":[]},{"id":"248","parent":"238","text":"Gum Neuropsychopharmacology 2026 → revisión narrativa de psicoterapia en mayores con depresión","guid":"Y6oftNWYQLGyldzyAWASUg","children":[]},{"id":"249","parent":"238","text":"OPS 2014 → mortalidad por suicidio en las Américas","guid":"zo2ad1x2QdKHtmjLGh40bg","children":[]},{"id":"250","parent":"238","text":"MINSAL Chile 2019 → guía práctica salud mental y prevención de suicidio en PM","guid":"_-kZY-FEQUyrTr1T9aeSNg","children":[]},{"id":"251","parent":"238","text":"Hoyl Rev Med Chile 2000 → validación chilena de GDS-5: S88% E90%","guid":"xRhN98TaQ12Mk3RA82PhnQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"252","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clínicas","guid":"6qD7TSgeTTqJS7aXXAYl5Q","children":[{"id":"253","parent":"252","text":"Perla 1: La depresión en mayores no se parece a la de los jóvenes → ansiedad, irritabilidad, fatiga, baja de peso, insomnio, quejas cognitivas; tristeza puede estar ausente","guid":"Pwj-ss8WSjmjO6ChD22XdA","children":[]},{"id":"254","parent":"252","text":"Perla 2: Toda queja de memoria nueva → tamizaje de depresión ANTES de etiquetar deterioro cognitivo (pseudodemencia depresiva es reversible)","guid":"7vdotxN2TpG_yds1SEEi4w","children":[]},{"id":"255","parent":"252","text":"Perla 3: GDS-5 en 2 min con S88% E90% en población chilena (Hoyl 2000) → 5 preguntas, validada; ≥2 positivas screen positivo","guid":"DAk4Th1nRjC5augtNvpAZA","children":[]},{"id":"256","parent":"252","text":"Perla 4: Tamizaje anual en APS → 80% de las depresiones se atienden ahí; sin tamizaje sistemático <50% se diagnostica y solo ~33% recibe tratamiento","guid":"OzYl8dIXTOuJTQS0r2KZrA","children":[]},{"id":"257","parent":"252","text":"Perla 5: Empezar con 1/2 dosis del adulto, subir lento → sertralina 25 mg, escitalopram 5 mg, mirtazapina 15 mg; aguda 6-8 sem","guid":"u8cpfAb_R0S5UanMwWDehg","children":[]},{"id":"258","parent":"252","text":"Perla 6: Sertralina y escitalopram > citalopram > paroxetina → sertralina la más segura; citalopram ≤20 mg/día (QT); paroxetina evitar; tricíclicos prohibidos por Beers","guid":"tHKdAF9JSZafc4MDiK4Kog","children":[]},{"id":"259","parent":"252","text":"Perla 7: Mirtazapina = caballito del geriatra → insomnio + bajo peso + ansiedad/depresión + Parkinson; subir rápido a 30 mg","guid":"VP9fJKDFSG6BJDcDX-TYfw","children":[]},{"id":"260","parent":"252","text":"Perla 8: Control de sodio a 2 sem, 1 mes y con cada ajuste de ISRS/IRSN → especialmente con tiazidas, opioides, tramadol, carbamazepina","guid":"EPoOyHDASSugESI1U9iUVQ","children":[]},{"id":"261","parent":"252","text":"Perla 9: El mayor que intenta suicidio LO LOGRA → tasa 12/100.000 en >70a; FR hombre, viudo reciente, >80a, dolor crónico, alcohol","guid":"IoIKJqMTSmOv1i-6i6jRcw","children":[]},{"id":"262","parent":"252","text":"Perla 10: TEC es opción real en mayor frágil (mortalidad 1/10.000, eficacia 80%) → no es \"último recurso desproporcionado\"; en depresión psicótica/refractaria/suicidio derivar antes de aceptar refractariedad","guid":"Y9BNTmsmRECrJuxgXymK9A","children":[]},{"id":"263","parent":"252","text":"Perla 11: DSM-5 INSUFICIENTE en mayor (Bergua 2026) → diagnóstico clínico amplio + GDS/PHQ; no descartar por no cumplir todos los criterios","guid":"mEm_-zNbSiKCLqc4anqhsA","children":[]},{"id":"264","parent":"252","text":"Perla 12: Late-life depression como pródromo o FR de demencia (Alexopoulos 2019) → en cada depresión tardía explorar dominios cognitivos y reevaluar a 6-12 meses","guid":"EVj7KyFMSeKVkc_C_MfQBw","children":[]}]},{"id":"265","parent":"0","text":"Conceptos examinados (Evaluaciones SGGCh 2026)","guid":"3rwXUbZATC-o3j8VncYTPg","children":[{"id":"266","parent":"265","text":"Evaluacion M2","guid":"Er-rK5WISaagNEx76M3WwA","children":[{"id":"267","parent":"266","text":"P18 (depresion + dolor cronico musculoesqueletico): DULOXETINA (IRSN, 30-60 mg/dia) -> unico AD aprobado para depresion + dolor cronico (neuropatico, fibromialgia, lumbalgia, artrosis); mirtazapina sin efecto analgesico, amitriptilina contraindicada (Beers anticolinergica), bupropion sin utilidad para dolor","guid":"weS8ica1TKOR44NHPlkuKg","children":[]},{"id":"268","parent":"266","text":"P21 (ISRS afirmacion correcta): ISRS aumentan riesgo de sangrado digestivo al usarse con AINES o corticoides -> inhiben captacion plaquetaria de serotonina; sinergia con antiplaquetarios/anticoagulantes; tambien hiponatremia, disfuncion sexual, caidas y fracturas (NO son inocuos)","guid":"OF8v_5UcQN6cANxtUiYGvw","children":[]}]},{"id":"269","parent":"265","text":"Evaluacion Final (transversales)","guid":"nsWLQEHaQSauL4bSzv8Xtg","children":[{"id":"270","parent":"269","text":"No hay items directos en Final; los conceptos clave (Duloxetina dolor + depresion, sangrado GI con AINE) quedan cubiertos por Eval M2","guid":"PtvJfSTzSru3jlXK-DGD0w","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"271","parent":"0","text":"Referencias (bibliografía oficial Dra. Marianne Born)","guid":"vIKHctTgRS2z60gBmKRVFw","children":[{"id":"272","parent":"271","text":"1. Kok RM, Reynolds CF 3rd. Management of Depression in Older Adults: A Review. JAMA. 2017;317(20):2114-2122","guid":"JriwBqg8QnO0pNkjClFjNQ","children":[]},{"id":"273","parent":"271","text":"2. McCall WV, Kintziger KW. Late Life Depression, A Global Problem with Few Resources. Psychiatr Clin N Am. 2013;36:475-481","guid":"ZcPPL8yXTKuq2v5ieUpegg","children":[]},{"id":"274","parent":"271","text":"3. Glover J, Srinivasan S. Assessment of the Person with Late-life Depression. Psychiatr Clin N Am. 2013;36:545-560","guid":"zo1It9rCReeJx6IeXBNP9w","children":[]},{"id":"275","parent":"271","text":"4. Bergua V, Blanchard C, Amieva H. Depression in Older Adults: Do Current DSM Diagnostic Criteria Really Fit? Clin Gerontol. 2026;49(2):224-261","guid":"HeZ-0qnMS3aB0m4cLdTX3w","children":[]},{"id":"276","parent":"271","text":"5. Steffens DC. Treatment-Resistant Depression in Older Adults. N Engl J Med. 2024;390(7):630-639","guid":"vj6b7aQhTUG5_wepoRoKbQ","children":[]},{"id":"277","parent":"271","text":"6. Kovich H, Kim W, Quaste AM. Pharmacologic Treatment of Depression. Am Fam Physician. 2023;107(2):173-181","guid":"g_o2LToqQZCzYDOOm8q_mw","children":[]},{"id":"278","parent":"271","text":"7. Organización Panamericana de la Salud. Mortalidad por suicidio en las Américas. 2014","guid":"NJgLvwSORMKnNTsLPvtZ8w","children":[]},{"id":"279","parent":"271","text":"8. Alexopoulos GS. Mechanisms and treatment of late-life depression. Transl Psychiatry. 2019;9:188","guid":"WO5W3Cn4SeCaO_2c5P651A","children":[]},{"id":"280","parent":"271","text":"9. Piel C, Quante A. Therapy Strategies for Late-life Depression: A Review. J Psychiatr Pract. 2023;29(1):15-30","guid":"-Ba1azWOQH2oMX0_WsZzJA","children":[]},{"id":"281","parent":"271","text":"10. Simon GE, Moise N, Mohr DC. Management of Depression in Adults: A Review. JAMA. 2024;332(2):141-152","guid":"52D1lSExT8KZfbosT5oJqQ","children":[]},{"id":"282","parent":"271","text":"11. Gum AM, Crawford NO. Psychotherapy for older adults with depression: a narrative review. Neuropsychopharmacology. 2026 (epub ahead of print)","guid":"Iizd4dfFSTylAipC2t76tg","children":[]},{"id":"283","parent":"271","text":"12. MINSAL Chile. Guía Práctica Salud Mental y prevención de suicidio en Personas Mayores. 2019","guid":"44iOBYgpS8ukzsED5TIWug","children":[]},{"id":"284","parent":"271","text":"13. Hoyl T, Valenzuela E, Marín PP. Tamizaje EDG-5 en AM Chile. Rev Med Chile. 2000;128(11):1199-1204","guid":"UL7Z6BonRk-dpU750ENA6A","children":[]}]}]},"node_count":284,"relations":[],"cross_references":[],"specialty":"Geriatría","folder":"Entidades clínicas/Geriatría","filename":"Vertigo_Urgencias_Geriatria_iPad","id":"map_164","resolved_references":[]}